Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:31.22,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 华盛顿 WTA500 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:31.22,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38}4-6 6-4 6-0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 佩古拉 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.36,0:00:03.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Alexandra Eala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.36,0:00:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历山德拉·伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Savor this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,好好享受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:08.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex Eala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:11.32,EN,,0,0,0,,seventh top 10 win this season
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是这位菲律宾姑娘本赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,as well for the Filipina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,第 7 场击败世界前十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家下午好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:29.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, oh my gosh, where do I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:29.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,天呐 我该从哪儿说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:32.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh first of all, of course, first and foremost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 当然 最重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:35.16,EN,,0,0,0,,congratulations, Jess, for an amazing week
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:35.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 杰西 这一周打得太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and you've had an amazing season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你这个赛季也非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Um it's always a pleasure to share the court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次能和你同场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是一种享受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I definitely learned so so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的学到了太多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Um especially from your forehand lines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是你的正手直线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:47.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and your backhand crosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你的反手斜线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:49.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um so I'm really looking forward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我特别期待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:52.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to hopefully many more finals with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:52.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,以后能和你打更多次决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:01:01.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, there's a long list of people I want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:01:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢的人有很长一串
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank and at the top
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,排在这串名单最前面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.24,EN,,0,0,0,,of that list is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:08.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, my mom, my dad, my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我妈妈 我爸爸 我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:13.36,EN,,0,0,0,,my team, Joan, who's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的团队 还有在那边的若安
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:17.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and Sandro, thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有桑德罗 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, they're my inner circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们是我最亲近的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:24.44,EN,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who who are putting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是他们每天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.92,EN,,0,0,0,,in the work every day with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,陪着我一起下功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:31.00,EN,,0,0,0,,who make me feel like I'm not enduring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我觉得我不是一个人在扛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:33.32,EN,,0,0,0,,alone or putting in the hard work alone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,也不是一个人在拼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.24,EN,,0,0,0,,because I know they're right there with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我知道他们就在我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:45.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank the medical staff here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢这里的医疗团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and the WTA medical staff
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢 WTA 的医疗团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:49.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and the tournament medical staff
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:49.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有赛事的医疗团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,for um helping me throughout the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周一直在帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank the tournament Mark
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢赛事 感谢马克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and and the sponsors Mubadala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有赞助商穆巴达拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.76,EN,,0,0,0,,for such an accommodating week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周安排得这么周到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.76,EN,,0,0,0,,An amazing an amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,一届非常 非常
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:02.20,EN,,0,0,0,,an amazing tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常出色的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and um you know moving the final
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们也知道 把决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:06.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to Monday was no easy feat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,挪到周一不是件容易的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but uh super memorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但特别难忘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So congratulations on a great tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你们办了一届很棒的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:21.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and of course, uh, to all my supporters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 还有所有支持我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:32.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:34.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you to all my supporters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢所有支持我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:38.68,EN,,0,0,0,,especially the Filipino community here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:38.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是菲律宾的同胞们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in DC and back home
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在华盛顿 也在国内
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:42.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and wherever you are in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有在世界各地的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:45.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I really, guys, I feel all the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的感受到了这些爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:50.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Salamat Mahabay and Madami Salat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Um yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:55.56,EN,,0,0,0,,before the final yesterday actually I I got
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实昨天决赛之前 我收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.48,EN,,0,0,0,,so many messages, sweet messages
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,好多消息 特别暖的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:59.72,EN,,0,0,0,,from my family and from my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,来自我的家人 也来自我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:03.00,EN,,0,0,0,,who are on tour wherever else on the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,有的在巡回赛上 有的在别处
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时就在想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel so much love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我被这么多爱包着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:08.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So standing here in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:12.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of all this love um my first chance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,被这么多爱围着 第一次有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.84,EN,,0,0,0,,at the title knowing it won't be my last
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿到冠军 而这不会是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:18.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and already having achieved this feat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:18.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,光是已经做到这一步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and this milestone for my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我的生涯就已经是一个里程碑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I knew that whatever would have happened
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道不管这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:23.80,EN,,0,0,0,,after this match it would all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后打成什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.48,EN,,0,0,0,,would have already been a win for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说都已经是一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:27.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank you everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I really look forward
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:31.22,EN,,0,0,0,,to seeing you guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,能再见到你们
